<title>UK: Thorn seen higher on first half profits.</title>
<headline>Thorn seen higher on first half profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in newly demerged electrical rentals company Thorn Plc were expected to open higher on Monday after first half profits topped most analysts expectations.</p>
<p>Pre-exceptional interim operating profits came in at 87 million stg compared with a consensus forecast of around 79 million stg.  </p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
